{
"p": "The stress is on the syllable before **-θηκ-**, except in **εμείς / εσείς**, where it moves onto **-θήκ-**. There is never an augment."
},
{
"p": "The everyday -μαι verbs and their aorists:"
},
{
"table": {
"head": [
"Present",
"Aorist",
"Present",
"Aorist"
],
"rows": [
[
